    <!-- MISSION / VISION -->
    <section class="py-12 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink mb-4">How we work</h2>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
              We don't think a person can be explained by any single theory. So we draw on different schools of psychotherapy, and decide together which way of working fits the subject at hand.
            </p>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
              We try to take up what you tell us not through symptoms alone, but together with the circumstances you're in. Everyone's story, relationships and feelings are their own.
            </p>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
              We don't see therapy as a process that hands out ready-made solutions. We see it as work that opens room for a person to understand themselves and what they've been through.
            </p>
            <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              What we aim to be is a safe and open place you can turn to when you need it.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- VALUES -->
    <section class="py-12 bg-warm">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <span class="inline-block text-xs font-medium text-primary bg-primary/10 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-4">Our Values</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">What we pay attention to</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4">{% icon "lock", "w-5 h-5" %}</div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Confidentiality</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Your sessions and your personal information are protected in line with confidentiality principles. What you say stays between you and your psychologist.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4">{% icon "heart", "w-5 h-5" %}</div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Non-Judgmental Space</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">No reason for coming is too small. We welcome you exactly as you are.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sage/30 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4">{% icon "clipboard", "w-5 h-5" %}</div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Evidence-Based Practice</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">We work with methods that have been researched, such as CBT and psychodynamic therapy.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4">{% icon "globe", "w-5 h-5" %}</div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Cultural Awareness</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">People on this island come from many different places. We take account of where someone has come from and what that means for them.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4">{% icon "people", "w-5 h-5" %}</div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Working Together</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">The process takes shape together. We start where you need to start, and you set the pace.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
